<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>College Subject Guide</title>

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #eef4ff;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 30px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 850px;
            margin: auto;
            background: white;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 18px;
        }

        h1 {
            text-align: center;
            color: #3157a6;
        }

        .subject {
            padding: 18px;
            margin: 15px 0;
            background: #f1f5ff;
            border-left: 5px solid #3157a6;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        h2 {
            color: #3157a6;
        }

        .tag {
            display: inline-block;
            background: white;
            padding: 7px 12px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            margin: 5px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

    <h1>🎓 College Subject Guide</h1>

    <div class="subject">
        <h2>💻 Programming</h2>
        <p>Learn programming logic, syntax, variables, conditions, loops and functions.</p>
        <span class="tag">C</span>
        <span class="tag">Python</span>
    </div>

    <div class="subject">
        <h2>🗄️ Database Management</h2>
        <p>Study databases, tables, keys, SQL queries and relationships.</p>
        <span class="tag">SQL</span>
        <span class="tag">DBMS</span>
    </div>

    <div class="subject">
        <h2>🌐 Web Development</h2>
        <p>Learn how websites are structured and styled.</p>
        <span class="tag">HTML</span>
        <span class="tag">CSS</span>
    </div>

    <div class="subject">
        <h2>⚙️ Software Engineering</h2>
        <p>Understand software development processes, requirements, design and testing.</p>
        <span class="tag">SDLC</span>
        <span class="tag">Testing</span>
    </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
